This file keeps web/dist non-empty in a fresh clone and in the module
zip: web/embed.go's `//go:embed all:dist` does not compile against an
empty directory. Without it, every library consumer of this module — a
thin-wrap binary importing weos/v3/web for SetStaticFS — fails to build
against a tagged version.

A build overlays the generated SPA into this directory rather than
replacing it, so this file survives and the static middleware serves it
at /PLACEHOLDER. That is intended, and there is nothing here that the
repository does not already say in public.

Do not delete it. If `git status` shows it deleted, an older build
removed it; restore it with `git checkout -- web/dist/PLACEHOLDER`.
